= Current limitations

The verified sensitivity diagnostic supports a numerical methods report. It does not establish sleep discrimination, biological robustness, individual prediction, or clinical utility. The 9D `v_norm` endpoint remains method-limited; Q/W_Q retains recording grain; destination and resilience may be unavailable.



